    <h1 class="ind-h1">Water Management for<br><em>Car Washes &amp; Service Stations.</em></h1>
    <p class="ind-sub">Car washes are among the most water-intensive commercial operations per square foot — and among the most technically advanced in water reclaim. WST audits reclaim systems for actual recovery efficiency, identifies billing misclassifications specific to the sector, and monitors for the continuous-flow faults that car wash equipment is prone to.</p>
