      <div class="approach-item">
      <div class="approach-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="2" y="3" width="12" height="10" rx="1"/><path d="M5 7h6M5 10h4"/></svg></div>
      <div><div class="approach-title">Reclaim System Performance Audit &amp; Recovery Rate Verification</div><div class="approach-body">Actual reclaim recovery rate measured against manufacturer specification and claimed performance. Tank sediment levels assessed. Chemical management programme reviewed. Fresh-to-reclaim ratio documented as the primary efficiency metric. Optimisation protocol implemented for recovery improvement.</div></div>
    </div><div class="approach-item">
      <div class="approach-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M8 3C5.2 3 3 5.2 3 8s2.2 5 5 5 5-2.2 5-5-2.2-5-5-5z"/><path d="M8 6v2l1.5 1.5"/></svg></div>
      <div><div class="approach-title">Discharge Classification Review &amp; Rate Reclassification</div><div class="approach-body">Current utility discharge classification reviewed against municipal industrial pretreatment schedule for vehicle service operations. Discharge monitoring data reviewed. Reclassification application prepared where a more favourable rate category is supported by the actual discharge profile.</div></div>
    </div><div class="approach-item">
      <div class="approach-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M2 14l4-4 4 4 4-8"/></svg></div>
      <div><div class="approach-title">IoT Monitoring &mdash; Fresh Supply, Reclaim Overflow, &amp; Equipment Runtime</div><div class="approach-body">Monitoring on fresh water supply, reclaim system overflow circuit, and equipment runtime correlation. Continuous-flow events — stuck valves, overflow bypass, equipment left running between operating hours — flagged within hours. Fresh-to-reclaim ratio tracked in real time against established baseline.</div></div>
    </div><div class="approach-item">
      <div class="approach-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 4h10M3 8h7M3 12h5"/></svg></div>
      <div><div class="approach-title">Water Use Permit Compliance Documentation</div><div class="approach-body">In municipalities with water use permit requirements for car washes, WST's monitoring data provides the verified consumption documentation required for permit renewal. Recovery rate documentation supports permit conditions related to minimum reclaim percentages.</div></div>
